				<r3d:description language="eng">With the support of TELOTA, the Library of the Berlin-Brandenburg Academy of Sciences and Humanities (BBAW) operates an institutional repository for the first and second publication of scholarly publications authored or edited by members or staff of the BBAW and its predecessor institutions. The edoc server makes the publications available to the worldwide scholarly community in open access and ensures their long-term archiving. The edoc server is thus part of the implementation of the Academy&#039;s Open Science mission statement. Since 11/2022 the edoc-server of the academy is as well accepting research data and is thus the institutional research data repository of the academy.</r3d:description>
